# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to configure the Pauli term truncation mechanism provided by the [qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#module-qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating) module.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menjelaskan cara mengonfigurasi mekanisme pemangkasan suku Pauli yang disediakan oleh modul [qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#module-qiskit_addon_obp.utils.truncating).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operator backpropagation (OBP) can be used to reduce the depth of quantum circuits at the cost of a more complex observable. In order to get meaningful results from OBP, one usually needs to truncate terms from their observable to prevent it from growing too large. One way to allow for deeper backpropagation into the circuit, while preventing the operator from growing too large, is to truncate terms with small coefficients, rather than adding them to the operator. Truncating terms can result in fewer quantum circuits to execute, but doing so results in some error in the final expectation value calculation, proportional to the magnitude of the truncated terms' coefficients.\n"
msgstr "Operator backpropagation (OBP) bisa dipakai untuk mengurangi depth circuit kuantum dengan konsekuensi observable yang lebih kompleks. Supaya OBP memberi hasil yang bermakna, biasanya kita perlu memangkas suku dari observable agar tidak tumbuh terlalu besar. Salah satu cara untuk memungkinkan backpropagation lebih dalam ke circuit sambil menjaga operator tidak terlalu besar adalah memangkas suku berkoefisien kecil, alih-alih menambahkannya ke operator. Pemangkasan suku bisa menghasilkan lebih sedikit circuit kuantum yang harus dijalankan, tapi akibatnya ada error pada perhitungan akhir nilai ekspektasi, sebanding dengan besar koefisien suku yang dipangkas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate) method takes an optional [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget), which configures the truncation of low-weight Pauli terms for each observable after the successful backpropagation of every slice.\n"
"The amount of terms that are truncated depends on various configuration parameters specified by the user.\n"
"As of now, only a single truncation strategy is available - the [truncate_binary_search](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncate_binary_search) method.\n"
"Given an observable and some _budget_ it will perform a binary search over the Pauli terms and coefficients within that observable to find the optimal threshold,\n"
"such that the sum of the truncated coefficients is maximal but lower than the budget.\n"
msgstr ""
"Metode [backpropagate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/qiskit-addon-obp#backpropagate) menerima [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget) opsional, yang mengonfigurasi pemangkasan suku Pauli berbobot rendah untuk setiap observable setelah backpropagation tiap slice berhasil.\n"
"Jumlah suku yang dipangkas bergantung pada berbagai parameter konfigurasi yang ditentukan pengguna.\n"
"Saat ini, hanya satu strategi pemangkasan yang tersedia - metode [truncate_binary_search](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncate_binary_search).\n"
"Diberikan sebuah observable dan sebuah _budget_, metode ini akan melakukan pencarian biner atas suku dan koefisien Pauli di dalam observable tersebut untuk menemukan threshold yang optimal,\n"
"sehingga jumlah koefisien yang dipangkas maksimal tapi lebih kecil dari budget.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note**: By default, the L1 norm is used to evaluate and bound the truncation error; however, the `p_norm` setting enables the specification of the Lp-norm to be used.\n"
"For more information on how to use that setting, refer to the [Use different Lp-norms for Pauli term truncation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/bound-error-using-p-norm) guide.\n"
"The following examples illustrate various ways of building an [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget) by using the accompanying [setup_budget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#setup_budget) function.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Catatan**: Secara default, norma L1 dipakai untuk mengevaluasi dan membatasi error pemangkasan; namun, pengaturan `p_norm` memungkinkan penentuan norma Lp yang akan dipakai.\n"
"Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara memakai pengaturan itu, lihat panduan [Use different Lp-norms for Pauli term truncation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp/guides/bound-error-using-p-norm).\n"
"Contoh-contoh berikut menggambarkan berbagai cara membangun [TruncationErrorBudget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#truncationerrorbudget) dengan fungsi pendampingnya, [setup_budget](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-truncating#setup_budget).\n"

