# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We will look at a single simple observable:\n"
msgstr "Kita akan melihat satu observable sederhana:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simplest case: a fixed truncation budget for each slice {#the-simplest-case-a-fixed-truncation-budget-for-each-slice}"
msgstr "Kasus paling sederhana: budget pemangkasan tetap untuk setiap slice {#the-simplest-case-a-fixed-truncation-budget-for-each-slice}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The available budget for truncation of Pauli terms can vary at each step of the backpropagation.\n"
"To understand how this works, we first look at the simplest case of a fixed truncation budget as specified by the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Budget yang tersedia untuk memangkas suku Pauli bisa berbeda di setiap langkah backpropagation.\n"
"Untuk memahami cara kerjanya, kita lihat dulu kasus paling sederhana, yaitu budget pemangkasan tetap yang ditentukan oleh pengguna.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The most straightforward way to specify the truncation budget is by using the `max_error_per_slice` argument.\n"
"In fact, this is what is being done in the [Reducing depth of circuits with operator backpropagation](/tutorials/operator-back-propagation) tutorial. Setting `max_error_per_slice` to a `float` results in each slice being allotted a budget equaling that value.\n"
"In the example below, we set this value to `0.001` which guarantees an implicit truncation error of at most `0.018`, if all 18 slices were backpropagated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara paling lugas untuk menentukan budget pemangkasan adalah dengan argumen `max_error_per_slice`.\n"
"Sebenarnya, inilah yang dilakukan di tutorial [Reducing depth of circuits with operator backpropagation](/tutorials/operator-back-propagation). Mengatur `max_error_per_slice` ke sebuah `float` membuat setiap slice mendapat budget sebesar nilai tersebut.\n"
"Di contoh di bawah, kita mengatur nilai ini ke `0.001`, yang menjamin error pemangkasan implisit paling besar `0.018`, jika semua 18 slice di-backpropagate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n"
"Note that any error budget remaining after backpropagating a slice and truncating terms with small coefficients will always be added to the following slice's error budget.\n"
"</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n"
"Perhatikan bahwa sisa error budget apa pun setelah backpropagation sebuah slice dan pemangkasan suku berkoefisien kecil akan selalu ditambahkan ke error budget slice berikutnya.\n"
"</div>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We next use the [OBPMetadata](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-metadata-obp-metadata) instance and the tools provided by the [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-visualization#module-qiskit_addon_obp.utils.visualization) module to visualize the backpropagation process.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya kita memakai instance [OBPMetadata](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-metadata-obp-metadata) dan tool dari modul [visualization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-obp/utils-visualization#module-qiskit_addon_obp.utils.visualization) untuk memvisualisasikan proses backpropagation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The top left plot** shows that we have enough budget to begin truncating observable terms after backpropagating the third slice. Starting from the third slice, we know that we truncate at least one term from each slice we backpropagate because we are incurring some truncation error after each slice.\n"
msgstr "**Plot kiri atas** menunjukkan bahwa kita punya cukup budget untuk mulai memangkas suku observable setelah backpropagation slice ketiga. Mulai dari slice ketiga, kita tahu bahwa kita memangkas setidaknya satu suku dari setiap slice yang kita backpropagate karena kita menanggung sejumlah error pemangkasan setelah tiap slice.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The top right plot** shows that the error budget grows to `.003` for the third slice. We see a sharp drop in remaining budget, which means terms were truncated from the observable. This is consistent with what we inferred from the top left plot.\n"
msgstr "**Plot kanan atas** menunjukkan bahwa error budget naik menjadi `.003` untuk slice ketiga. Kita melihat penurunan tajam pada sisa budget, yang berarti ada suku yang dipangkas dari observable. Ini konsisten dengan yang kita simpulkan dari plot kiri atas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The bottom left plot** shows that as we truncate terms from our observable, our overall accumulated error is growing monotonically. This graph also confirms that no terms were truncated until after the third slice had been backpropagated.\n"
msgstr "**Plot kiri bawah** menunjukkan bahwa saat kita memangkas suku dari observable, error akumulasi keseluruhan kita naik secara monoton. Grafik ini juga mengonfirmasi bahwa tidak ada suku yang dipangkas sampai slice ketiga selesai di-backpropagate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **The bottom right plot** shows that the number of commuting Pauli groups in our observable has grown to the specified limit of `10`. This plot also shows how backpropagating one more layer would cause our observable to outgrow the specified bound as you can see from the crossover of the black and red lines.\n"
"<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n"
"Note that in all of these plots, the x-axis enumerates the backpropagated slices, but since OBP works on the end of the circuit, `slice 1` is the very last slice, `slice 2` is the one before that, and so on.\n"
"</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"- **Plot kanan bawah** menunjukkan bahwa jumlah grup Pauli yang commute di observable kita sudah tumbuh sampai batas yang ditentukan, yaitu `10`. Plot ini juga menunjukkan bagaimana backpropagation satu layer lagi akan membuat observable kita melewati batas yang ditentukan, seperti terlihat dari persilangan garis hitam dan merah.\n"
"<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n"
"Perhatikan bahwa di semua plot ini, sumbu x menghitung slice yang di-backpropagate, tapi karena OBP bekerja dari ujung circuit, `slice 1` adalah slice paling akhir, `slice 2` adalah slice sebelumnya, dan seterusnya.\n"
"</div>\n"

